  "description": "SiCare.Auth.Provider is a lightweight authentication helper for .NET applications, supporting OAuth token management and secure external login URL generation. Designed for .NET Standard 1.1 and .NET 8 compatibility, it simplifies requesting refresh tokens and appending query parameters to URLs. Ideal for authentication workflows in enterprise applications.",
